# GeoStrom AI — environment configuration template
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust. `.env` is git-ignored and must never be
# committed. This file contains NAMES ONLY — never real values or secrets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# === DATA_ROOT (required) ==================================================
# Absolute path to dataset storage. HARD REQUIREMENTS:
#   1. MUST NOT be inside the OneDrive folder    (C:\Users\<you>\OneDrive\...)
#   2. MUST NOT be inside this Git repository
#   3. MUST be on a drive with >= ~50 GB free for the MVP subset
#
# NOTE for this machine: OneDrive "Known Folder Move" is ACTIVE, which means
# Desktop, Documents AND Pictures are all redirected into OneDrive. Do not use
# any of them. A folder directly under C:\ or under the user profile root is
# safe.
#
# Verified-writable candidates on this workstation (pick one, or set your own):
#   DATA_ROOT=C:\GeoStromData                  <- default assumed by the tooling
#   DATA_ROOT=C:\Users\Twinkle\GeoStromData
#
# Use forward slashes or escaped backslashes if your shell requires it.
DATA_ROOT=C:\GeoStromData

# === Later phases — not used in Phase 1 ====================================
# Uncomment as each phase begins. Present here only so the contract is visible.

# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://user:password@localhost:5432/geostrom
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
